            - "• Built QuickSight dashboards to explore trends and engagement metrics"
            - ""
            - "<strong>Automation & Security</strong>"
            - ""
            - "• Applied event-driven triggers using Lambda"
            - "• Configured IAM roles following least-privilege access"
